OL,5,G0100 Call the Bailiffs: Time to Pay Up!
OL,6,     FIn London, Scott and police
OL,7,     Fofficers remove squatters from a
OL,8,     Fcouncil-owned building where
OL,9,     Fthey've been living for nearly a
OL,10,     Fyear. But one woman barricades
OL,11,     Fherself in a room.
OL,12,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FBarnsley's A&E department is put
OL,14,     Funder the microscope. There are
OL,15,     Fcomplications when Wendy, who
OL,16,     Fsuffers from kidney failure, is
OL,17,     Fadmitted with a heart condition.
